      <p class="text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        TypeSafe describes two technical innovations: a <strong>parallel sampler</strong> (the model evaluates all questions at once instead of generating tokens sequentially) and <strong>RLCD</strong> — Reinforcement Learning for Calibrated Decisions (the training objective).
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-xs">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-border">
              <th class="text-left py-3 px-3 text-secondary font-mono font-normal">Method</th>
